load_config precedence dictates how configuration values are determined; strongest source overrides weaker ones. Analyzing the provided configurations, environment overrides file config, and tenant overrides environment if both define the same parameter. With the given values, the tenant configuration provides the endpoint, while the file configuration defines timeout when the environment does not.

Therefore, endpoint is `https://tenant.local`, timeout is `7`, with source precedence being tenant > file config > environment.


